WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
A metal reel turns on an ivory workbench. Copper tape runs off its edge.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.100
The camera follows the tape between stacked metal plates.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.750
Amber film advances through a rectangular gate and catches the light.
